## 8. Part 6: Phase 2 — Intelligent Template Scaling ("Teach Scaling")

Following `TRUFOLD_PHASE_1_2_TEMPLATE_SCALING_WORKFLOW.md` and the user's architectural axiom:

### A. The Canonical 2D Geometry Rule
> **The 2D sheet-metal geometry (`DsfDocument`) is the single source of truth.**
>
> 3D geometry is never directly deformed or arbitrarily interpolated. When modifying a parameter (e.g. Width from $100\text{ mm}$ to $150\text{ mm}$):
> 1. Compute parameter delta: $\Delta W = W(t) - W_{\text{baseline}}$.
> 2. Apply parametric behaviors to the canonical 2D flat blank (`outerContour`, `bends`, `faces`, `punches`, `cutLines`).
> 3. Validate 2D geometry (contour closure, bend consistency).
> 4. Fold the exact 2D state using [KinematicFoldEngine](file:///d:/FlutterProjects/trufold_studio/lib/sheet_metal_studio/engine/kinematic_fold_engine.dart).
> 5. Recalculate derived 3D physical ports from the newly generated 3D mesh.

```
       Change Width (e.g. 100 ➔ 150 mm)
                     │
                     ▼
       Modify Canonical 2D Geometry
                     │
                     ▼
               Validate 2D
                     │
                     ▼
         Fold That Exact 2D State
         (KinematicFoldEngine)
                     │
                     ▼
                Generate 3D
                     │
                     ▼
       Recalculate Derived Port Geometry
```

### B. Pure Parametric Scaling Model
- **File**: [cms_scaling_model.dart](file:///d:/FlutterProjects/trufold_studio/lib/sheet_metal_studio/models/cms/cms_scaling_model.dart)
- Models the 4 core geometric behaviors:
  1. `STRETCH`: Floor web expands along transverse bend axis.
  2. `TRANSLATE`: Sidewall faces and locked flanges shift rigidly outward.
  3. `RIGID`: Coupler fastener slots maintain exact geometry ($12.0\text{ mm} \times 8.0\text{ mm}$) and reference edge mounting distance.
  4. `DERIVED`: 3D port mouths automatically recalculate from the folded 3D state.
- Supports progressive teaching states: `untaught`, `learning`, `learned`.
- Dynamic rigid feature group naming: `Coupler Slots (${punches.length})` (never a hardcoded count).

### C. Scaling Controller & Morph Engine
- **File**: [cms_scaling_controller.dart](file:///d:/FlutterProjects/trufold_studio/lib/sheet_metal_studio/engine/cms/cms_scaling_controller.dart)
- `evaluateMorph(value)`:
  - Scales canonical 2D flat blank for width/height.
  - Folds updated document into 3D.
  - Re-measures opening apertures and confirms zero punch distortion.
- `acceptScalingModel()`:
  - Marks parameters as `learned`.
  - Persists the validated `CmsScalingModel` into the DSF document metadata (`metadata['cmsTemplate']['scalingModel']`).

